  TC_CLOCK_GROUP       Actived   set_clock_groups -asynchronous -group [get_clocks {clk50 sclk}] -group [get_clocks {bus80_clk}] -group [get_clocks {core_clk}] -group [get_clocks {rtc_clk}] -group [get_clocks {ddr3_ref_clk ddr3_mem_clk ddr3_sys_clk}]  
